<title>USA: Country Star says preferred converted.</title>
<headline>Country Star says preferred converted.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Country Star Restaurants Inc on Monday said each share of its six percent Series A convertible preferred stock has been automatically converted into six shares of company common stock, effective May 10.</p>
</text>
